# Cloudflare Pages headers (copied from /public into the build output).
#
# NOTE: This project uses @dimforge/rapier3d-COMPAT, whose WASM is inlined as
# base64 and therefore runs WITHOUT cross-origin isolation (no SharedArrayBuffer).
# That means it works on Cloudflare Pages AND plain static hosting.
#
# Uncomment the COOP/COEP pair only when switching to a SharedArrayBuffer-capable
# Rapier build. Keep compat until a preview-domain full regression passes.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  # Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  # Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
